  "description": "Asebi is a flower shop owner whose intimidating aura tends to scare his customers away. One day, a girl being chased suddenly rushes into his shop. He soon learns that she’s the daughter of the strongest dragon in the world. When soldiers come to capture her, Asebi easily drives them off. But this quiet florist has secrets of his own… and the girl isn’t the only one hiding a mysterious power.\nAnd so begins the journey of an unlikely duo, the flower seller and the dragon girl, as they travel the world together to gather the scattered powers of dragons.",
